# INVWINRN.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the row count on
# the status bar, "n items" after the data directory and the user.  The
# item list opens on the seed's three items, counted; Next order counts
# them again.  An item added by INS and OK shows its note beside the
# count, one more; DEL and Yes one less.  CTRL-D on item 1 and OK on the
# copy, its quantity changed, one more; CTRL-D and ESC on the copy
# unchanged, which deletes it again, none.  Split units on item 2, two
# units, splitting one off, one more.  The frame maximized and
# restored opens the list again in its new size, the count kept.  The
# end by Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINRN.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
S OPEN
K ALT-C R
S TAB
K ALT-I I
S BYID
# a new item, its note, then the count
K INS
T SYS
K ALT-M
T Compaq
K ALT-L
T A1
K ENTER
S ADDED
K HOME
S ADDCOUNT
# the new item, the last row, deleted
K END DEL Y
S DELETED
K HOME
S DELCOUNT
# item 1's copy saved: 5 TABs from the category reach the quantity
K CTRL-D TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB
T 2
K ENTER
S COPIED
K HOME
S CPYCOUNT
# a copy left unchanged by ESC is deleted again
K CTRL-D
S COPY
K ESC
S COPYESC
# one of item 2's two units split off
K HOME DOWN ALT-C U
T 1
K ENTER
S SPLIT
K HOME
S SPLCOUNT
K ALT-SPACE X
S MAX
K ALT-SPACE R
S RESTORE
K ALT-F X
